<title>ISRAEL: SOCCER-ISRAEL BEAT CYPRUS 4-3 IN UNDER-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ISRAEL BEAT CYPRUS 4-3 IN UNDER-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel beat Cyprus 4-3 (halftime 3-3) in a European under-21 soccer championship group 5 qualifier on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Israel - Eli Abarbanel, 12, 43 Nir Sivilia 22 Shuki Nagar, 85</p>
<p>Cyprus - Michalis Nophytou, 5, 21 Panayiotis Panayiotou 45</p>
<p>Attendance: 11,000</p>
</text>
